here we learn all the docker cli cmd 

  to check the conatiner detailslike noof container ,containerid, image, createddate , status etc 
  `docker ps `

to run ubutnu container 
 for interactive terminal `docker run -it conatiner_name`<-- "-it stands for interactive terminal "
 for run in background `docker run -d container_Name`
 for some port require continer like nginx `docker run -d -p 80:80 container_Name `

to stop docker conatainer 
`docker stop container_ID `

to create dockerfile to docker image 
`docker build `

 to delete the docker container 
`docker rm container_ID`

to show all the stopped container 
`docker ps -a`

to delete all the docker container togather 
`docker system prune`  
























